/Title (Children struggle to read and decode letters, have poor working memory, and find it hard to keep up in fast-paced digital environments. Beyond academics, they face social communication difficulties such as fear of making mistakes in front of peers, withdrawal from group learning, and low self-belief creating cycles of isolation and disengagement.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4194 0 R
>>
endobj
