<<
/Title (No game-based solution exists that targets these social dimensions. On the technology side, no system combines multiplayer + multimodal + dual-device \(mobile + PC\) interaction for dyslexic children. Tools rely heavily on post-error feedback, lack voice-enabled peer interaction, and ignore social confidence entirely.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4197 0 R
>>
